WEBVTT

00:00:00.196 --> 00:00:00.929
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:04.879
Being imprecise using -<i><b>ish</b></i>

00:00:05.844 --> 00:00:06.549
1

00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:09.187
<v><b>A:</b></v> What colour are her eyes?

00:00:09.337 --> 00:00:10.953
<v><b>B:</b></v> A sort of greenish brown.

00:00:12.753 --> 00:00:13.483
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.372 --> 00:00:16.070
<v><b>A:</b></v> What time do you usually get up?

00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:19.258
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, normally 6-ish, but later at weekends.

00:00:21.075 --> 00:00:21.909
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.665 --> 00:00:23.669
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you hungry?

00:00:23.866 --> 00:00:26.601
<v><b>B:</b></v> Ish. I don’t mind stopping for lunch if you want to?